    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Note: Outpost was an experimental game that is no longer in development. Enjoy the free Early Access demo and check out the newest Lunar Workshop titles below!</h2><br>Outpost is a building and planet exploration game. An entire planet is available for you to explore.<br><br>Outpost is in an early alpha development state. We have released the very first playable version of the game with only a few features. Additional features will be added over time, one release every month.<br><br>Current features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore and collect resources.<br></li><li> Build and customize your home.<br></li><li> Walk around the entire planet if you like, but it will take you a very long time.</li></ul>",
